WEBVTT

00:00.757 --> 00:04.540
[SPEAKER_04]: Second and Wealsun, around 3.20pm.

00:07.162 --> 00:09.643
[SPEAKER_04]: Folsom, you're with your unit.

00:10.284 --> 00:13.966
[SPEAKER_04]: You're part of a crossbow unit that is part of the Monmurian fleet.

00:15.047 --> 00:26.635
[SPEAKER_01]: And you and Tyrus have been ordered to report to the Royal Docks for a mission.

00:28.497 --> 00:29.958
[SPEAKER_01]: So you and Tyrus

00:32.035 --> 00:48.636
[SPEAKER_01]: Along with your marine sergeant have traveled from the harbor district down to the royal docks where a COSERA is waiting and you see many, many platoons of marines

00:50.197 --> 00:50.838
[SPEAKER_04]: Collecting there.

00:51.778 --> 01:01.984
[SPEAKER_04]: Tyrus, your entire detachment is collecting at the Royal Docks for some strange mission.

01:03.384 --> 01:13.810
[SPEAKER_01]: Basically you're sitting there, your sergeant is giving orders, and the men are basically arming themselves and moving their equipment onto the boat as are 250 other Marines.

01:13.890 --> 01:15.711
[SPEAKER_01]: So there's something strange going on.

01:16.855 --> 01:20.918
[SPEAKER_01]: Most of the men are asking questions and you hear them talking among themselves.

01:20.938 --> 01:21.538
[SPEAKER_01]: Where are we going?

01:21.558 --> 01:22.319
[SPEAKER_01]: What is this for?

01:23.580 --> 01:28.683
[SPEAKER_01]: Some people are basically saying, I don't know, we're going to reinforce somewhere.

01:28.783 --> 01:32.546
[SPEAKER_01]: Other people are saying that there are assaults that are going to happen.

01:33.346 --> 01:34.727
[SPEAKER_01]: You're not sure of these things.

01:37.709 --> 01:46.015
[SPEAKER_01]: There seems to be a lot of discussion regarding Helm Island and some strange storm that occurred last night.

01:46.670 --> 01:47.370
[SPEAKER_01]: Near the island.

01:48.831 --> 01:49.971
[SPEAKER_01]: Very confusing though.

01:50.311 --> 01:55.973
[SPEAKER_01]: The fact that the royal docks are being used to sally forth from this are doubly strange.

01:57.813 --> 02:14.718
[SPEAKER_01]: However, it becomes a little more obvious when a strange figure walks down from the royal palace on their personal

02:17.294 --> 02:17.995
[SPEAKER_01]: A stairwell.

02:21.798 --> 02:31.165
[SPEAKER_01]: A figure dressed in black clothing, which is strange because it's kind of hot and it seems like that would be very, very suffocating.

02:32.186 --> 02:36.609
[SPEAKER_01]: Wearing a silvered mask over his face.

02:40.232 --> 02:41.533
[SPEAKER_01]: He's accompanied also by a

02:45.763 --> 02:53.366
[SPEAKER_01]: A terse-looking elf, who's wearing a hat, trying to, in some way, disguise the fact that he's elven.

02:54.306 --> 03:04.930
[SPEAKER_01]: But the two of them walk past the marines, causing some kind of a... people to stop and look.

03:05.010 --> 03:06.291
[SPEAKER_01]: It's kind of strange.

03:06.611 --> 03:11.633
[SPEAKER_01]: And then they walk up and get onto the top deck, the steerage deck, with the captain.

03:15.060 --> 03:20.381
[SPEAKER_01]: One of the Marines says, I think that's Paul Ribeiro.

03:22.762 --> 03:24.002
[SPEAKER_01]: I've only heard rumors of him.

03:24.702 --> 03:25.982
[SPEAKER_01]: He's Prince Jeon's nephew.

03:31.884 --> 03:33.564
[SPEAKER_04]: Where are we?

03:33.764 --> 03:38.285
[SPEAKER_04]: You guys, you walk up, right, and you actually know these two guys, okay?

03:41.452 --> 03:46.243
[SPEAKER_04]: Merrick is a well-known scout and navigator.

03:48.528 --> 03:49.589
[SPEAKER_01]: In the Monmurgian Navy.

03:49.649 --> 03:56.873
[SPEAKER_01]: He actually is attached directly with Lord Seamus, but you know the sergeants and you know these two guys from whatever.

03:57.873 --> 04:02.836
[SPEAKER_04]: With him is this kind of older-looking, rough-looking guy.

04:03.257 --> 04:03.457
[SPEAKER_04]: Okay.

04:04.537 --> 04:06.819
[SPEAKER_04]: I would say he's not that much older than you guys, maybe.

04:07.419 --> 04:07.839
[SPEAKER_04]: Human though?

04:08.119 --> 04:08.580
[SPEAKER_04]: He's human.

04:08.640 --> 04:09.320
[SPEAKER_04]: He's Oeridian.

04:09.420 --> 04:10.221
[SPEAKER_04]: Yeah, definitely.

04:10.861 --> 04:16.524
[SPEAKER_04]: A seagoing man, armed like a Marine, definitely.

04:17.485 --> 04:17.705
[SPEAKER_03]: Okay.

04:19.882 --> 04:22.363
[SPEAKER_03]: Which one was Paul Rivera there?

04:23.383 --> 04:24.123
[SPEAKER_03]: Did they point it out?

04:24.824 --> 04:29.285
[SPEAKER_04]: Paul Rivera is standing on the top deck and they're talking about him.

04:29.745 --> 04:34.906
[SPEAKER_04]: He's got this metal mask, this silvered mask on his face.

04:36.067 --> 04:39.128
[SPEAKER_04]: Kind of like, you know, I'm going to describe it this way.

04:40.608 --> 04:47.690
