07:21.590 --> 07:23.611
[SPEAKER_00]: And I'm with him.

07:23.652 --> 07:24.172
[SPEAKER_00]: He's with him.

07:24.192 --> 07:24.712
[SPEAKER_00]: Okay.

07:25.052 --> 07:32.818
