07:36.300 --> 07:36.921
[SPEAKER_02]: Merrick's Oeridian.

07:36.941 --> 07:37.881
[SPEAKER_02]: You're all Arideans.

07:37.961 --> 07:38.322
[SPEAKER_02]: All of us.

07:38.402 --> 07:38.702
[SPEAKER_02]: All of us.

07:38.762 --> 07:39.142
[SPEAKER_02]: Okay.

07:45.787 --> 07:46.287
